<section class="auth-card">
  <div class="auth-brand"><i class="mdi mdi-shield-key-outline"></i><span>TeslaMate</span></div>
  <h1>两步验证</h1>
  <p>输入验证器中的 6 位动态码，或输入一枚未使用的恢复码。</p>
  <p :if={@error} class="notification is-danger" role="alert"><%= @error %></p>
  <.form for={%{}} action="/sign_in/verify" method="post" class="platform-form">
    <div class="field">
      <label class="label" for="verification-code">动态码或恢复码</label>
      <input id="verification-code" name="verification[code]" class="input" type="text" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="64" required autofocus />
    </div>
    <button class="button is-primary is-fullwidth" type="submit">验证并登录</button>
  </.form>
  <p class="help">动态码每 30 秒更新，同一枚动态码只能使用一次。</p>
  <a href="/sign_in">返回邮箱密码登录</a>
</section>
